config BR2_PACKAGE_DMX_PANEL
	bool "dmx-panel demo application"
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
	help
	  LVGL framebuffer/evdev demo application for the Allwinner A333
	  1280x800 MIPI panel. The installed systemd service starts it in
	  simulation mode and does not open the RS485 device.

	  The application sources are kept in oem/a333/src/dmx-panel and
	  include the LVGL version used by the original Luckfox application.
